OL,3,GNEWSAFree Christmas parking plan sparks
OL,4,Adebate among traders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Christmas parking offer aimed at
OL,7,Fboosting city centre footfall has been
OL,8,Fwelcomed by traders, but some say it
OL,9,Fdoes not go far enough.
OL,11,FFree parking will be available at most
OL,12,FCity of Wolverhampton Council-owned car
OL,13,Fparks after 15:00 GMT throughout
OL,14,FDecember.
OL,16,FThe authority said the scheme was
OL,17,Fdesigned to encourage shoppers into the
OL,18,Fcity centre and support businesses
OL,19,Fduring the festive period.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
