OL,3,GNEWSAFree Christmas parking plan sparks
OL,4,Adebate among traders
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile traders welcomed the move, some
OL,7,Fargued parking only becoming free after
OL,8,F15:00 limited its benefit and raised
OL,9,Fconcerns about parking provision
OL,10,Felsewhere in the city centre.
